      "message": "Logic looks to say that BD9995X_CMD_CHGOP_SET2_CHG_EN will always be \u00270\u0027 when battery is disconnected as well.  Is there ever a chance that isn\u0027t true?  Should we be looking at some battery presence signal directly instead?",
